ar as prefer\\u00eancias de navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o. Se permitir a utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de cookies, as suas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais poder\\u00e3o ser armazenadas por n\\u00f3s e utilizadas por terceiros.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nNem n\\u00f3s, nem terceiros, oferecemos qualquer garantia quanto \\u00e0 exatid\\u00e3o, atualidade, desempenho, integridade ou adequa\\u00e7\\u00e3o das informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es e materiais encontrados ou oferecidos neste site para qualquer finalidade espec\\u00edfica. <\\/li><li>Reconhece que tais informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es e materiais podem conter imprecis\\u00f5es ou erros, e exclu\\u00edmos expressamente a responsabilidade por quaisquer imprecis\\u00f5es ou erros, na m\\u00e1xima medida permitida por lei.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nA utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de qualquer informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o ou material neste site \\u00e9 inteiramente por sua conta e risco, e n\\u00e3o nos responsabilizamos por quaisquer consequ\\u00eancias decorrentes dessa utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li><li>Ser\\u00e1 da sua inteira responsabilidade garantir que quaisquer produtos, servi\\u00e7os ou informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es dispon\\u00edveis atrav\\u00e9s deste site v\\u00e3o ao encontro das suas necessidades espec\\u00edficas.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nEste site cont\\u00e9m material que \\u00e9 propriedade nossa ou licenciado para n\\u00f3s. <\\/li><li>Este material inclui, entre outros, o design, o layout, a apar\\u00eancia e os gr\\u00e1ficos.<\\/li><li>A reprodu\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e9 proibida, exceto em conformidade com o aviso de direitos de autor, que faz parte destes termos e condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nA utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o n\\u00e3o autorizada deste site pode dar origem a uma a\\u00e7\\u00e3o de indemniza\\u00e7\\u00e3o por danos e\\/ou constituir um crime.\\r\\n<\\/li><li>\\r\\nOcasionalmente, este site tamb\\u00e9m pode incluir links para outros sites. <\\/li><li>Estes links s\\u00e3o fornecidos para sua conveni\\u00eancia, a fim de fornecer mais informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es. <\\/li><li>Isto n\\u00e3o significa que endossamos o(s) site(s). N\\u00e3o nos responsabilizamos pelo conte\\u00fado do(s) site(s) hiperligado(s).<\\/li><\\/ol>\"},\"page_slug\":\"terms_and_conditions\",\"template_name\":\"page_content\",\"page_url\":\"\",\"login\":\"on\",\"header\":\"off\",\"footer\":\"on\"},{\"menubar_page_name\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"menubar_page_contant\":{\"zh\":\"<p>\\u7b80\\u4ecb\\uff1a<\\/p><p><br>\\u9690\\u79c1\\u653f\\u7b56\\u6982\\u8ff0\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u653f\\u7b56\\u7684\\u76ee\\u7684\\u548c\\u8303\\u56f4\\u3002\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u6536\\u96c6\\uff1a<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>\\u6709\\u5173\\u4ece\\u7528\\u6237\\/\\u5ba2\\u6237\\u6536\\u96c6\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u7c7b\\u578b\\u7684\\u8be6\\u7ec6\\u8bf4\\u660e\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982\\u4e2a\\u4eba\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff08\\u59d3\\u540d\\u3001\\u5730\\u5740\\u3001\\u7535\\u5b50\\u90ae\\u4ef6\\uff09\\u3001\\u8bbe\\u5907\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u3001\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u6570\\u636e\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u4efb\\u4f55\\u5176\\u4ed6\\u76f8\\u5173\\u6570\\u636e\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u6570\\u636e\\u4f7f\\u7528\\uff1a\\u8bf4\\u660e\\u6240\\u6536\\u96c6\\u7684\\u6570\\u636e\\u5c06\\u5982\\u4f55\\u88ab\\u4f7f\\u7528\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u670d\\u52a1\\u3001\\u4ea7\\u54c1\\u6539\\u8fdb\\u3001\\u4e2a\\u6027\\u5316\\u3001\\u5206\\u6790\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u4efb\\u4f55\\u5176\\u4ed6\\u5408\\u6cd5\\u5546\\u4e1a\\u76ee\\u7684\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u6570\\u636e\\u5171\\u4eab\\uff1a\\u5173\\u4e8e\\u516c\\u53f8\\u662f\\u5426\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u5982\\u4f55\\u4e0e\\u7b2c\\u4e09\\u65b9\\uff08\\u5982\\u5408\\u4f5c\\u4f19\\u4f34\\u3001\\u670d\\u52a1\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u5546\\u6216\\u5173\\u8054\\u516c\\u53f8\\uff09\\u5171\\u4eab\\u7528\\u6237\\u6570\\u636e\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u5171\\u4eab\\u7684\\u76ee\\u7684\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u6570\\u636e\\u5b89\\u5168\\uff1a\\u6709\\u5173\\u4e3a\\u4fdd\\u62a4\\u7528\\u6237\\u6570\\u636e\\u514d\\u906d\\u672a\\u7ecf\\u6388\\u6743\\u7684\\u8bbf\\u95ee\\u3001\\u4e22\\u5931\\u6216\\u6ee5\\u7528\\u6240\\u91c7\\u53d6\\u63aa\\u65bd\\u7684\\u8be6\\u7ec6\\u8bf4\\u660e\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u52a0\\u5bc6\\u3001\\u5b89\\u5168\\u534f\\u8bae\\u3001\\u8bbf\\u95ee\\u63a7\\u5236\\u548c\\u6570\\u636e\\u6cc4\\u9732\\u901a\\u77e5\\u7a0b\\u5e8f\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u7528\\u6237\\u9009\\u9879\\uff1a\\u6709\\u5173\\u7528\\u6237\\u5728\\u5176\\u4e2a\\u4eba\\u6570\\u636e\\u7684\\u6536\\u96c6\\u3001\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u548c\\u5171\\u4eab\\u65b9\\u9762\\u53ef\\u9009\\u62e9\\u7684\\u9009\\u9879\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u9000\\u51fa\\u673a\\u5236\\u548c\\u8d26\\u6237\\u8bbe\\u7f6e\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cookies \\u548c\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\\u6280\\u672f\\uff1a\\u89e3\\u91ca\\u5982\\u4f55\\u4f7f\\u7528 cookies\\u3001\\u7f51\\u7edc\\u4fe1\\u6807\\u548c\\u7c7b\\u4f3c\\u6280\\u672f\\u6765\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\\u7528\\u6237\\u6d3b\\u52a8\\uff0c\\u5e76\\u4e3a\\u5206\\u6790\\u548c\\u5e7f\\u544a\\u76ee\\u7684\\u6536\\u96c6\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u7b2c\\u4e09\\u65b9\\u94fe\\u63a5\\uff1a\\u8bf4\\u660e\\u516c\\u53f8\\u7684\\u7f51\\u7ad9\\u6216\\u670d\\u52a1\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5305\\u542b\\u6307\\u5411\\u7b2c\\u4e09\\u65b9\\u7f51\\u7ad9\\u6216\\u670d\\u52a1\\u7684\\u94fe\\u63a5\\uff0c\\u5e76\\u4e14\\u9690\\u79c1\\u653f\\u7b56\\u4e0d\\u9002\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u8fd9\\u4e9b\\u5916\\u90e8\\u7f51\\u7ad9\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u6570\\u636e\\u4fdd\\u7559\\uff1a\\u6709\\u5173\\u7528\\u6237\\u6570\\u636e\\u7684\\u4fdd\\u5b58\\u671f\\u9650\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u516c\\u53f8\\u5c06\\u5b58\\u50a8\\u8fd9\\u4e9b\\u6570\\u636e\\u591a\\u957f\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u7684\\u8be6\\u7ec6\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u6cd5\\u5f8b\\u4f9d\\u636e\\u4e0e\\u5408\\u89c4\\u6027\\uff1a\\u6709\\u5173\\u5904\\u7406\\u4e2a\\u4eba\\u6570\\u636e\\u7684\\u6cd5\\u5f8b\\u4f9d\\u636e\\u3001\\u9075\\u5b88\\u9002\\u7528\\u6570\\u636e\\u4fdd\\u62a4\\u6cd5\\u5f8b\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u7528\\u6237\\u5728\\u76f8\\u5173\\u9690\\u79c1\\u6cd5\\u89c4\\uff08\\u4f8b\\u5982 GDPR\\u3001CCPA\\uff09\\u4e0b\\u6743\\u5229\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u9690\\u79c1\\u653f\\u7b56\\u66f4\\u65b0\\uff1a\\u901a\\u77e5\\u9690\\u79c1\\u653f\\u7b56\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u4f1a\\u5b9a\\u671f\\u66f4\\u65b0\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u7528\\u6237\\u5c06\\u5982\\u4f55\\u83b7\\u77e5\\u4efb\\u4f55\\u91cd\\u5927\\u66f4\\u6539\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u8054\\u7cfb\\u65b9\\u5f0f\\uff1a\\u7528\\u6237\\u5982\\u4f55\\u5c31\\u4e0e\\u9690\\u79c1\\u76f8\\u5173\\u7684\\u7591\\u95ee\\u6216\\u95ee\\u9898\\u8054\\u7cfb\\u516c\\u53f8\\u3002<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\",\"en\":\"<p>Introduction:<\\/p><p><br>Overview of the privacy policy, including the purpose and scope of the policy. Information Collection:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Details about the types of information collected from users\\/customers, such as personal information (name, address, email), device information, usage data, and any other relevant data.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Use of Data: An explanation of how the collected data will be used, including providing services, product improvement, personalization, analysis, and any other legitimate business purposes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Data Sharing: Information on whether and how the company shares user data with third parties, such as partners, service providers, or affiliates, along with the purposes of such sharing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Data Security: Details about the measures taken to protect user data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse, including encryption, secure protocols, access controls, and data breach notification procedures.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>User Choices: Information about the options available to users regarding the collection, use, and sharing of their personal data, including opt-out mechanisms and account settings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cookies and Tracking Technologies: Explanation of the use of cookies, web beacons, and similar technologies to track user activity and collect information for analytics and advertising purposes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Third-Party Links: Clarification that the company\\u2019s website or services may contain links to third-party websites or services and that the privacy policy does not extend to those external sites.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Data Retention: Details on the retention period of user data and how long it will be stored by the company.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Legal Basis and Compliance: Information about the legal basis for processing personal data, compliance with applicable data protection laws, and users\' rights under relevant privacy regulations (e.g., GDPR, CCPA).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Privacy Policy Updates: Notice that the privacy policy may be updated periodically and how users will be informed of any material changes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Contact Information: How users can contact the company regarding privacy-related concerns or questions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\",\"es\":\"<p>Introducci\\u00f3n:<\\/p><p><br>Descripci\\u00f3n general de la pol\\u00edtica de privacidad, incluyendo el prop\\u00f3sito y el alcance de la pol\\u00edtica. Recopilaci\\u00f3n de informaci\\u00f3n:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Detalles sobre los tipos de informaci\\u00f3n recopilada de los usuarios\\/clientes, como informaci\\u00f3n personal (nombre, direcci\\u00f3n, correo electr\\u00f3nico), informaci\\u00f3n del dispositivo, datos de uso y cualquier otro dato relevante.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Uso de datos: Explicaci\\u00f3n de c\\u00f3mo se utilizar\\u00e1n los datos recopilados, incluyendo la prestaci\\u00f3n de servicios, la mejora del producto, la personalizaci\\u00f3n, el an\\u00e1lisis y cualquier otro fin comercial leg\\u00edtimo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Intercambio de datos: Informaci\\u00f3n sobre si la empresa comparte datos de los usuarios con terceros y c\\u00f3mo lo hace, como socios, proveedores de servicios o afiliados, junto con los fines de dicho intercambio.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Seguridad de los datos: Detalles sobre las medidas adoptadas para proteger los datos de los usuarios contra el acceso no autorizado, la p\\u00e9rdida o el uso indebido, incluyendo cifrado, protocolos seguros, controles de acceso y procedimientos de notificaci\\u00f3n de brechas de datos.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Opciones del usuario: Informaci\\u00f3n sobre las opciones disponibles para los usuarios con respecto a la recopilaci\\u00f3n, uso e intercambio de sus datos personales, incluidos los mecanismos de exclusi\\u00f3n y la configuraci\\u00f3n de la cuenta.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cookies y tecnolog\\u00edas de seguimiento: Explicaci\\u00f3n sobre el uso de cookies, balizas web y tecnolog\\u00edas similares para rastrear la actividad del usuario y recopilar informaci\\u00f3n con fines anal\\u00edticos y publicitarios.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enlaces de terceros: Aclaraci\\u00f3n de que el sitio web o los servicios de la empresa pueden contener enlaces a sitios o servicios de terceros y que la pol\\u00edtica de privacidad no se extiende a esos sitios externos.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Retenci\\u00f3n de datos: Detalles sobre el per\\u00edodo de conservaci\\u00f3n de los datos de los usuarios y cu\\u00e1nto tiempo ser\\u00e1n almacenados por la empresa.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Base legal y cumplimiento: Informaci\\u00f3n sobre la base legal para el tratamiento de datos personales, el cumplimiento de las leyes de protecci\\u00f3n de datos aplicables y los derechos de los usuarios en virtud de las normativas de privacidad relevantes (por ejemplo, GDPR, CCPA).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Actualizaciones de la pol\\u00edtica de privacidad: Notificaci\\u00f3n de que la pol\\u00edtica de privacidad puede actualizarse peri\\u00f3dicamente y c\\u00f3mo se informar\\u00e1 a los usuarios sobre cualquier cambio importante.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Informaci\\u00f3n de contacto: C\\u00f3mo los usuarios pueden contactar con la empresa en relaci\\u00f3n con inquietudes o preguntas relacionadas con la privacidad.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\",\"fr\":\"<p>Introduction :<\\/p><p><br>Vue d\\u2019ensemble de la politique de confidentialit\\u00e9, y compris son objectif et son champ d\\u2019application. Collecte d\\u2019informations :<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>D\\u00e9tails sur les types d\\u2019informations collect\\u00e9es aupr\\u00e8s des utilisateurs\\/clients, telles que les informations personnelles (nom, adresse, e-mail), les informations sur l\\u2019appareil, les donn\\u00e9es d\\u2019utilisation et toute autre donn\\u00e9e pertinente.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Utilisation des donn\\u00e9es : Explication de la mani\\u00e8re dont les donn\\u00e9es collect\\u00e9es seront utilis\\u00e9es, notamment pour la fourniture de services, l\\u2019am\\u00e9lioration du produit, la personnalisation, l\\u2019analyse et tout autre objectif commercial l\\u00e9gitime.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Partage des donn\\u00e9es : Informations sur si et comment l\\u2019entreprise partage les donn\\u00e9es des utilisateurs avec des tiers, tels que des partenaires, des prestataires de services ou des affili\\u00e9s, ainsi que les finalit\\u00e9s de ce partage.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>S\\u00e9curit\\u00e9 des donn\\u00e9es : D\\u00e9tails sur les mesures prises pour prot\\u00e9ger les donn\\u00e9es des utilisateurs contre l\\u2019acc\\u00e8s non autoris\\u00e9, la perte ou l\\u2019utilisation abusive, y compris le chiffrement, les protocoles s\\u00e9curis\\u00e9s, les contr\\u00f4les d\\u2019acc\\u00e8s et les proc\\u00e9dures de notification des violations de donn\\u00e9es.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Choix de l\\u2019utilisateur : Informations sur les options disponibles pour les utilisateurs concernant la collecte, l\\u2019utilisation et le partage de leurs donn\\u00e9es personnelles, y compris les m\\u00e9canismes de d\\u00e9sinion et les param\\u00e8tres du compte.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cookies et technologies de suivi : Explication de l\\u2019utilisation des cookies, des balises web et des technologies similaires pour suivre l\\u2019activit\\u00e9 des utilisateurs et collecter des informations \\u00e0 des fins d\\u2019analyse et de publicit\\u00e9.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Liens tiers : Clarification que le site web ou les services de l\\u2019entreprise peuvent contenir des liens vers des sites ou services tiers et que la politique de confidentialit\\u00e9 ne s\\u2019applique pas \\u00e0 ces sites externes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Conservation des donn\\u00e9es : D\\u00e9tails sur la dur\\u00e9e de conservation des donn\\u00e9es des utilisateurs et sur la dur\\u00e9e pendant laquelle elles seront stock\\u00e9es par l\\u2019entreprise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Base l\\u00e9gale et conformit\\u00e9 : Informations sur la base l\\u00e9gale du traitement des donn\\u00e9es personnelles, la conformit\\u00e9 aux lois applicables en mati\\u00e8re de protection des donn\\u00e9es et les droits des utilisateurs en vertu des r\\u00e9glementations de confidentialit\\u00e9 pertinentes (par exemple, RGPD, CCPA).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Mises \\u00e0 jour de la politique de confidentialit\\u00e9 : Notification que la politique de confidentialit\\u00e9 peut \\u00eatre mise \\u00e0 jour p\\u00e9riodiquement et comment les utilisateurs seront inform\\u00e9s de tout changement important.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Informations de contact : Comment les utilisateurs peuvent contacter l\\u2019entreprise concernant des pr\\u00e9occupations ou des questions li\\u00e9es \\u00e0 la confidentialit\\u00e9.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\",\"pt\":\"<p>Introdu\\u00e7\\u00e3o: <\\/p><p><br>Vis\\u00e3o geral da pol\\u00edtica de privacidade, incluindo a finalidade e o \\u00e2mbito da pol\\u00edtica. Recolha de informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o: <\\/p><ol><li>Detalhes sobre os tipos de informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o recolhida dos utilizadores\\/clientes, tais como informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais (nome, morada, e-mail), informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es do dispositivo, dados de utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o e quaisquer outros dados relevantes. <\\/li><li>Utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de dados: Uma explica\\u00e7\\u00e3o de como os dados recolhidos ser\\u00e3o utilizados, incluindo o fornecimento de servi\\u00e7os, a melhoria do produto, a personaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o, a an\\u00e1lise e quaisquer outros fins comerciais leg\\u00edtimos. <\\/li><li>Partilha de dados: Informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o sobre se e como a empresa partilha dados do utilizador com terceiros, como parceiros, fornecedores de servi\\u00e7os ou afiliados, juntamente com as finalidades dessa partilha. <\\/li><li>Seguran\\u00e7a de dados: Detalhes sobre as medidas tomadas para proteger os dados do utilizador contra acesso n\\u00e3o autorizado, perda ou utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o indevida, incluindo encripta\\u00e7\\u00e3o, protocolos seguros, controlos de acesso e procedimentos de notifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o de viola\\u00e7\\u00e3o de dados. <\\/li><li>Op\\u00e7\\u00f5es do utilizador: Informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o sobre as op\\u00e7\\u00f5es dispon\\u00edveis para os utilizadores em rela\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e0 recolha, utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o e partilha dos seus dados pessoais, incluindo mecanismos de desativa\\u00e7\\u00e3o e defini\\u00e7\\u00f5es de conta. <\\/li><li>Cookies e Tecnologias de Rastreio: Explica\\u00e7\\u00e3o sobre a utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de cookies, web beacons e tecnologias similares para rastrear a atividade do utilizador e recolher informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es para fins de an\\u00e1lise e publicidade.<\\/li><li>Links de Terceiros: Esclarecimento de que o site ou os servi\\u00e7os da empresa podem conter links para sites ou servi\\u00e7os de terceiros e que a pol\\u00edtica de privacidade n\\u00e3o se estende a esses sites externos.<\\/li><li>Reten\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Dados: Detalhes sobre o per\\u00edodo de conserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o dos dados do utilizador e por quanto tempo ser\\u00e3o armazenados pela empresa.<\\/li><li>Base Legal e Conformidade: Informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o sobre a base legal para o tratamento de dados pessoais, a conformidade com as leis de prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o de dados aplic\\u00e1veis \\u200b\\u200be os direitos dos utilizadores ao abrigo das normas de privacidade relevantes (por exemplo, RGPD, CCPA).<\\/li><li>Atualiza\\u00e7\\u00f5es da Pol\\u00edtica de Privacidade: Notifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o de que a pol\\u00edtica de privacidade pode ser atualizada periodicamente e como os utilizadores ser\\u00e3o informados sobre quaisquer altera\\u00e7\\u00f5es substanciais.<\\/li><li>Informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es de Contacto: Como os utilizadores podem contactar a empresa em rela\\u00e7\\u00e3o a preocupa\\u00e7\\u00f5es ou d\\u00favidas relacionadas com a privacidade.<\\/li><\\/ol>\"},\"page_slug\":\"privacy_policy\",\"template_name\":\"page_content\",\"page_url\":\"\",\"login\":\"on\",\"header\":\"off\",\"footer\":\"on\"}]', '2024-11-05 01:04:23', '2026-01-31 08:09:25'),
