(32, 'discover_of_features', '[\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099306-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Gestão\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>- ntegração de processos: financeiro, contabilidade, compras, vendas, estoque, produção, RH e ativos.<p><p>Base de dados única: um banco de dados comum para evitar duplicidade de dados e discrepâncias.<p><p>Fluxos de trabalho (workflows): automação de processos com aprovações, notificações e trilhas de auditoria.<p><p>Configuração baseada em regras: paramétrico para adaptar a empresa sem código.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099306-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Management\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>- Process integration: finance, accounting, purchasing, sales, inventory, production, HR and assets.<p><p>Single database: common database to avoid data duplication and discrepancies.<p><p>Workflows: automation with approvals, notifications, and audit trails.<p><p>Rule-based configuration: parameterized to adapt the company without code.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099306-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Gestion\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>- Intégration des processus : finances, comptabilité, achats, ventes, inventaire, production, RH et actifs.<p><p>Base de données unique : base de données commune pour éviter la duplication et les divergences.<p><p>Flux de travail : automatisation avec approbations, notifications et pistes d\'audit.<p><p>Configuration basée sur les règles : paramétrique pour adapter l\'entreprise sans code.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099306-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Gestión\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>- Integración de procesos: finanzas, contabilidad, compras, ventas, inventario, producción, RRHH y activos.<p><p>Base de datos única: base de datos común para evitar duplicación y discrepancias.<p><p>Flujos de trabajo: automatización con aprobaciones, notificaciones y auditorías.<p><p>Configuración basada en reglas: parametrizada para adaptar la empresa sin código.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099306-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"管理\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>- 流程集成：财务，会计，采购，销售，库存，生产，人力资源和资产。<p><p>单一数据库：统一数据库以避免数据重复和差异。<p><p>工作流：自动化处理，包括审批、通知和审计跟踪。<p><p>基于规则的配置：无需编码即可适应公司。</p>\"},\n  \n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099328-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Finanças e contabilidade\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Contabilidade geral e auxiliar: lançamentos, balancetes, razão, demonstrações financeiras.<p><p>Gestão de contas a pagar/receber: faturas, cobranças, reconciliação bancária.<p><p>Controle de fluxo de caixa: previsões, cenários, gestão de caixa.<p><p>Conformidade e auditoria: trilha de alterações, controladoria, impostos.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099328-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Finance & Accounting\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>General and subsidiary accounting: entries, trial balances, ledger, financial statements.<p><p>Accounts payable/receivable management: invoices, collections, bank reconciliation.<p><p>Cash flow control: forecasts, scenarios, cash management.<p><p>Compliance and audit: change logs, controlling, taxes.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099328-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Finance & Comptabilité\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Comptabilité générale et auxiliaire : écritures, balances, grand livre, états financiers.<p><p>Gestion des comptes fournisseurs/clients : factures, recouvrements, rapprochement bancaire.<p><p>Contrôle de trésorerie : prévisions, scénarios, gestion de trésorerie.<p><p>Conformité et audit : journal des modifications, contrôle, impôts.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099328-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Finanzas y contabilidad\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Contabilidad general y auxiliar: asientos, balances, libro mayor, estados financieros.<p><p>Gestión de cuentas por pagar/recibir: facturas, cobros, conciliación bancaria.<p><p>Control de flujo de caja: pronósticos, escenarios, gestión de efectivo.<p><p>Cumplimiento y auditoría: registro de cambios, control, impuestos.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099328-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"财务与会计\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>总账和辅助账：凭证、试算表、分类账、财务报表。<p><p>应收/应付管理：发票、催收、银行对账。<p><p>现金流控制：预测、情景分析、现金管理。<p><p>合规与审计：变更日志、控制、税务。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099359-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Operações e cadeia de suprimentos\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestão de estoque: entradas, saídas, controle de lotes, rastreabilidade, consumo por centro de custo.<p><p>Compras e fornecedores: cotações, pedidos, contratos, avaliação de fornecedores.<p><p>Vendas e CRM: pipeline de vendas, orçamentos, pedidos, faturamento.<p><p>Logística: entregas, roteirização, gestão de devoluções.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099359-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Operations & Supply Chain\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Inventory management: entries, exits, batch control, traceability, cost center consumption.<p><p>Purchasing & suppliers: quotes, orders, contracts, supplier evaluation.<p><p>Sales & CRM: sales pipeline, budgets, orders, invoicing.<p><p>Logistics: deliveries, routing, returns management.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099359-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Opérations & chaîne d\'approvisionnement\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestion des stocks : entrées, sorties, contrôle des lots, traçabilité, consommation par centre de coûts.<p><p>Achats et fournisseurs : devis, commandes, contrats, évaluation des fournisseurs.<p><p>Ventes et CRM : pipeline de ventes, budgets, commandes, facturation.<p><p>Logistique : livraisons, routage, gestion des retours.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099359-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Operaciones y cadena de suministro\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestión de inventario: entradas, salidas, control de lotes, trazabilidad, consumo por centro de costo.<p><p>Compras y proveedores: cotizaciones, pedidos, contratos, evaluación de proveedores.<p><p>Ventas y CRM: pipeline de ventas, presupuestos, pedidos, facturación.<p><p>Logística: entregas, enrutamiento, gestión de devoluciones.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099359-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"运营与供应链\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>库存管理：入库、出库、批次控制、按成本中心消耗。<p><p>采购与供应商：报价、订单、合同、供应商评估。<p><p>销售与CRM：销售管道、预算、订单、发票。<p><p>物流：交付、路线规划、退货管理。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099377-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"RH e pessoal\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Folha de pagamento: cálculos, encargos, benefícios.<p><p>Gestão de talentos: recrutamento, desempenho, treinamento.<p><p>Ponto e folha de presença: horários, faltas, licenças.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099377-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"HR & Personnel\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Payroll: calculations, charges, benefits.<p><p>Talent management: recruitment, performance, training.<p><p>Time & attendance: schedules, absences, leaves.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099377-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"RH & Personnel\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Paiement : calculs, charges, avantages.<p><p>Gestion des talents : recrutement, performance, formation.<p><p>Présence : horaires, absences, congés.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099377-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"RRHH y personal\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Nómina: cálculos, cargos, beneficios.<p><p>Gestión del talento: reclutamiento, desempeño, formación.<p><p>Asistencia: horarios, ausencias, permisos.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099377-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"人力资源与人员\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>工资单：计算、费用、福利。<p><p>人才管理：招聘、绩效、培训。<p><p>考勤：时间表、缺勤、假期。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099401-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Projetos\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestão de projetos: orçamentos, alocação de recursos, cronogramas.<p><p>CRM/Relacionamento com clientes: histórico, tickets, atendimento.<p><p>Gestão de contratos: contratos com clientes e fornecedores, renovação.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099401-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Projects\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Project management: budgets, resource allocation, timelines.<p><p>CRM/Customer relations: history, tickets, support.<p><p>Contract management: client and vendor contracts, renewal.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099401-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Projets\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestion de projets : budgets, allocation des ressources, calendriers.<p><p>CRM/Relations clients : historique, tickets, support.<p><p>Gestion des contrats : contrats clients et fournisseurs, renouvellement.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099401-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Proyectos\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Gestión de proyectos: presupuestos, asignación de recursos, cronogramas.<p><p>CRM/Relaciones con clientes: historial, tickets, soporte.<p><p>Gestión de contratos: contratos de clientes y proveedores, renovación.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099401-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"项目\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>项目管理：预算、资源分配、时间表。<p><p>客户关系管理：历史、工单、支持。<p><p>合同管理：客户和供应商合同，续签。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099416-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Tecnologia e gestão de dados\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Integrações nativas: conectores para e-commerce, marketplaces, gateways de pagamento, logística.<p><p>APIs e webhooks: para customizações e integrações com serviços externos.<p><p>Relatórios e BI: dashboards, KPIs, análise de dados em tempo real.<p><p>Segurança e conformidade: controle de acesso, autenticação multifator, logs de auditoria.<p><p>Escalabilidade: multi-empresa (brevemente), multi-idioma, hospedagem (on-cloud)</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099416-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Technology & Data Management\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Native integrations: connectors for e-commerce, marketplaces, payment gateways, logistics.<p><p>APIs & webhooks: for customizations and integrations with external services.<p><p>Reports & BI: dashboards, KPIs, real-time data analysis.<p><p>Security & compliance: access control, MFA, audit logs.<p><p>Scalability: multi-company (soon), multi-language, cloud hosting.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099416-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Technologie et gestion des données\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Intégrations natives : connecteurs pour e-commerce, marketplaces, passerelles de paiement, logistique.<p><p>APIs et webhooks : pour personnalisations et intégrations avec services externes.<p><p>Rapports & BI : tableaux de bord, KPI, analyse de données en temps réel.<p><p>Sécurité & conformité : contrôle d\'accès, MFA, journaux d\'audit.<p><p>Scalabilité : multi-entreprise (bientôt), multi-langue, hébergement cloud.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099416-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Tecnología y gestión de datos\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Integraciones nativas: conectores para comercio electrónico, marketplaces, pasarelas de pago, logística.<p><p>APIs y webhooks: para personalizaciones e integraciones con servicios externos.<p><p>Informes y BI: paneles, KPIs, análisis de datos en tiempo real.<p><p>Seguridad y cumplimiento: control de acceso, MFA, registros de auditoría.<p><p>Escalabilidad: multiempresa (próximamente), multilengua, alojamiento en la nube.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099416-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"技术与数据管理\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>原生集成：电子商务、市场、支付网关、物流的连接器。<p><p>API 和 webhooks：用于定制和与外部服务集成。<p><p>报告与 BI：仪表板、关键指标、实时数据分析。<p><p>安全与合规：访问控制、多因素认证、审计日志。<p><p>可扩展性：多公司（即将）、多语言、云托管。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099434-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Usabilidade e suporte\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Interface unificada: um único ambiente para todas as áreas.<p><p>Personalização e configuração sem código: campos, formulários, regras de negócio.<p><p>Móvel e acessibilidade: app para dispositivos móveis, responsivo.<p><p>Suporte e comunidade: base de conhecimento.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099434-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Usability & Support\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Unified interface: a single environment for all areas.<p><p>Customization & configuration without code: fields, forms, business rules.<p><p>Mobile & accessibility: mobile app, responsive.<p><p>Support & community: knowledge base.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099434-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Utilisabilité & Support\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Interface unifiée : un environnement unique pour toutes les zones.<p><p>Personnalisation & configuration sans code : champs, formulaires, règles métier.<p><p>Mobile & accessibilité : application mobile, responsive.<p><p>Support & communauté : base de connaissances.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099434-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Usabilidad y soporte\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Interfaz unificada: un único entorno para todas las áreas.<p><p>Personalización y configuración sin código: campos, formularios, reglas de negocio.<p><p>Móvil y accesibilidad: app móvil, responsivo.<p><p>Soporte y comunidad: base de conocimientos.</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099434-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"可用性与支持\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>统一界面：适用于所有区域的单一环境。<p><p>无需编码的自定义与配置：字段、表单、业务规则。<p><p>移动与可访问性：移动应用，响应式。<p><p>支持与社区：知识库。</p>\"},\n\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099443-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"pt\",\"discover_heading\":\"Implementação e governança\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Migração de dados: importação de dados legados.<p><p>Governança de dados: padrões de qualidade, deduplicação, normalização.<p><p>Atualizações e manutenção: frequência de atualizações, downtime, planos de serviço</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099443-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"en\",\"discover_heading\":\"Implementation & Governance\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Data migration: import of legacy data.<p><p>Data governance: quality standards, deduplication, normalization.<p><p>Updates & maintenance: update frequency, downtime, service plans</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099443-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"fr\",\"discover_heading\":\"Mise en œuvre et gouvernance\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Migration de données : importation de données héritées.<p><p>Gouvernance des données : normes de qualité, déduplication, normalisation.<p><p>Mises à jour et maintenance : fréquence des mises à jour, temps d\'arrêt, plans de service</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099443-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"es\",\"discover_heading\":\"Implementación y gobernanza\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>Migración de datos: importación de datos heredados.<p><p>Gobernanza de datos: estándares de calidad, deduplicación, normalización.<p><p>Actualizaciones y mantenimiento: frecuencia de actualizaciones, tiempo de inactividad, planes de servicio</p>\"},\n  {\"discover_logo\":\"1688099443-discover_logo.png\",\"discover_language\":\"zh\",\"discover_heading\":\"实施与治理\",\"discover_description\":\"<p>数据迁移：导入遗留数据。<p><p>数据治理：质量标准、去重、标准化。<p><p>更新与维护：更新频率、停机时间、服务计划</p>\"}\n]\n', '2024-11-05 01:04:23', '2026-01-28 06:30:09'),
