(40, 'plan_description', '{\"pt\":\"O pacote TOP \\u00e9 o mais popular, e se est\\u00e1 a iniciar o seu neg\\u00f3cio, n\\u00e3o hesite em considerar o plano anual JOVEM (desenvolvido para startups e jovens).\",\"en\":\"The TOP package is the most popular, and if you are starting your business, do not hesitate to consider the YOUNG annual plan (designed for startups and young entrepreneurs).\",\"es\":\"El paquete TOP es el m\\u00e1s popular, y si est\\u00e1 iniciando su negocio, no dude en considerar el plan anual JOVEN (dise\\u00f1ado para startups y j\\u00f3venes).\",\"fr\":\"Le forfait TOP est le plus populaire, et si vous d\\u00e9marrez votre entreprise, n\'h\\u00e9sitez pas \\u00e0 envisager le plan annuel JEUNE (con\\u00e7u pour les startups et les jeunes).\",\"zh\":\"TOP \\u5957\\u9910\\u6700\\u53d7\\u6b22\\u8fce\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u60a8\\u521a\\u5f00\\u59cb\\u521b\\u4e1a\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u8003\\u8651\\u5e74\\u5ea6 YOUNG \\u8ba1\\u5212\\uff08\\u4e3a\\u521d\\u521b\\u516c\\u53f8\\u548c\\u5e74\\u8f7b\\u4eba\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\uff09\\u3002\"}', '2024-11-05 01:04:23', '2026-01-28 07:08:47'),
